classDiagram
    class IAPPlatform {
        <<abstract>>
        +Init() UniTask
        +Purchase(product)
        #SetRequestBody(receipt) RequestPurchaseToPlatform
        #ConfirmPurchase(ack)*
    }
    class SteamIAP {
        -resPrices : CallResult
        -_crStartPurchase : CallResult
        +RefreshPrices()
        +GetAllItems()
        -OnRequestPricesResult()
        -OnMicTxnAuthResponse()
        -OnInventoryResultReady()
    }
    class MobileIAP {
        -storeController
        -orderMap
        -OnPurchasePending()
        -OnPurchasesFetched()
        +ConfirmPurchase(ack)
    }
    class PlatformServer {
        +영수증 검증
        +지급 확정
    }

    IAPPlatform <|-- SteamIAP
    IAPPlatform <|-- MobileIAP
    IAPPlatform ..> PlatformServer : 영수증 검증 요청

    note for IAPPlatform "공통 라이프사이클\nInit → Pending → Validate → Confirm\n플랫폼별로 내부 구현만 분기"
